，與施績、全熙攻公安督融。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-huan","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line029:m0143"],"paragraph_ids":["c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line029"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line029:m0143","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line029:m0143"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-sanguozhi-051-huan"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-wu051-huan-3","subject_person_id":"7vy_ws7_yb6","object_person_id":"wpk_253_fu9","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"壹弟封"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-051","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-051-huan","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line029","quote":"　　奐亦愛樂儒生，覆命部曲子弟就業，後仕進朝廷者數十人。年四十，嘉禾三年卒。子承嗣，以昭武中郎將代統兵，領郡。赤烏六年卒，無子，封承庶弟壹奉奐後，襲業為將。孫峻之誅諸葛恪也，壹與全熙、施績攻恪弟公安督融，融自殺。壹從鎮南遷鎮軍，假節督夏口。及孫綝誅滕胤、呂據，據、胤皆壹皆之妹夫也，壹弟封又知胤、據謀，自殺。綝遣朱異潛襲壹。異至武昌，壹知其攻己，率部曲千餘口過將胤妻奔魏。魏以壹為車騎將軍、儀同三司，封吳侯，以故主芳貴人邢氏妻子。邢美色妒忌，下不堪命，遂共殺壹及邢氏。壹入魏三年死。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line029:m0143","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-051-huan:line029:m0068"}],"interpretation_note":"以此來源所述兩端為據。","status":"source_attes